> * Both index and ID must be specified.

I'm still a little unsure on this point. It looks like using `SearchExecutionContext#indexMatches` would allow you to use a wildcard (`"_index": "*"`), which I think would be the same as not requiring it at all. Wildcards also mean we need to handle the issue of duplicate IDs in multiple indices (switching to dis max).

